    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701200105/7012001050010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "どうしたんだ？",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7012001050020,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "いえ……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701200105/7012001050020"
  },
  {
    "id": 7012001050030,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "凛世も、\r\n嬉しく……思います",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701200105/7012001050030"
  },
  {
    "id": 7012001050040,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "『W.I.N.G.』に……\r\n近づいて、いるのですね……",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701200105/7012001050040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ。凛世はここまで来たんだ",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7012001050050,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "プロデューサーさま\r\n凛世は、少し、変なのです……",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701200105/7012001050050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "変？",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7012001050060,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "ご期待に、応えられることが\r\n凛世の、喜びだと、思っておりましたが……",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701200105/7012001050060"
  },
  {
    "id": 7012001050070,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "それだけではなく……",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701200105/7012001050070"
  },
  {
    "id": 7012001050080,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "その、申し訳ありません\r\nこの気持ちを、どう表現すれば……",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701200105/7012001050080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ。うん……たぶん、俺にもわかるよ",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7012001050090,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "おわかりに、なるのですね",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701200105/7012001050090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "嫌な気持ちじゃないんだよな？\r\nこう……",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7012001050100,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "はい……胸の奥にぽっと、\r\nろうそくの、火が灯るような……",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701200105/7012001050100"
  },
  {
    "id": 7012001050110,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "あのステージでは、\r\nきっと、この気持ちも……",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701200105/7012001050110"
  },
  {
    "id": 7012001050120,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "プロデューサーさま、凛世は……\r\n凛世を見ていてくださる方々のために、励みます",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701200105/7012001050120"
  },
  {
    "id": 7012001050130,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "ご指導を、お願い申し上げます",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701200105/7012001050130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、もちろん！\r\nこちらこそ、これからもよろしくな、凛世",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
